MCU LOKI MULTIVERSE  
// ASCII map  

FUNDAMENTALS
  time          linear flow of events inside one universe
  timeline      one complete history of a universe
  branch        new timeline spawned by a Nexus Event
  nexus_event   deviation from scripted path
  prune         TVA reset: send branch + variant to the Void
  sacred        He Who Remains approved set of timelines
                that all produce him and no other Kang
  loom          Temporal Loom: failsafe that weaves / deletes
                branches so only Sacred remains
  void          End of Time dump for pruned matter + Alioth
  yggdrasil     post-S2 structure: infinite coexisting branches
                held alive by Loki at the End of Time

TYPES
  Timeline
    SacredTimeline      isolated collection, Earth-616 baseline
    BranchedTimeline    unsanctioned fork
    DeadTimeline        pruned / dying strand
  Variant
    LokiVariant         any Loki off-script
    KangVariant         He Who Remains | Kang | others
    TVAVariant          agents who are themselves variants
  Entity
    TVA                 Time Variance Authority (outside time)
    Alioth              cloud that eats leftover timelines
    TemporalLoom        machine / failsafe
    Citadel             He Who Remains throne at End of Time

